# Laravel 13 Only

This application runs **Laravel 13** (`laravel/framework` ^13, currently 13.x).

When building or changing features:

- Use **only Laravel 13** APIs, Artisan generators, scaffolding, config layout, and docs.
- Do **not** use Laravel 10/11/12-only patterns, removed helpers, old directory layouts, or outdated training defaults.
- Before writing version-sensitive code, confirm with Boost `search-docs` or the installed framework (`composer show laravel/framework`, source under `vendor/laravel/framework`).
- Prefer modern Laravel 13 conventions already used in this app (e.g. `bootstrap/app.php` style, `casts()` method, anonymous migrations) over legacy equivalents.
